<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Normandy shares in active trade.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Normandy shares in active trade.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Normandy Mining Ltd saw active trade on Thursday with over 10.4 million shares traded.</p>
<p>While turnover was high, brokers said most of the activity was normal two-way business with the bulk of trade in one line of 9.0 million shares specialled through BZW Australia at a price of A$1.70 per share.</p>
<p>By 2.10 p.m. (0310 GMT), Normandy shares were two cents lower at A$1.74.</p>
<p>-- Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
